Provenance
----------

These files were authored for this repository and contain no third-party
material.

Record any machine-generated art here as it is added -- the tool, the model and
the date -- so downstream users can judge its status for themselves.
GameEngine.Editor.ImageGen produces such art via a local ComfyUI workflow; the
waiver above is intended to apply to its output regardless of whether that
output attracts copyright in a given jurisdiction.
